+ ‘‘Pañcannaṃ bhikkhusatānaṃ, katakiccāna tādinaṃ; Khīṇāsavānaṃ
  vimalānaṃ, khaṇena sannipātayi.

+ ‘‘Lokappasādanaṃ nāma, pāṭihīraṃ nidassayi; Amhepi tattha gantvāna,
  vandissāma mayaṃ jinaṃ.

+ ‘‘Etha sabbe gamissāma, pucchissāma mayaṃ jinaṃ; Kaṅkhaṃ
