+ Khīṇāsavehi vimalehi, dantehi uttame dame; Sāriputto mahāpañño,
  iddhiyā upasaṅkami.

+ Tehi bhikkhūhi parivuto, sāriputto mahāgaṇī; Laḷanto devova gagane,
  iddhiyā upasaṅkami.

+ Ukkāsitañca khipitaṃ \[ukkāsitañca khipitañca (syā. aṭṭha.)\],
