+ Dibbacakkhūnaṃ yo aggo, anuruddho mahāgaṇī; Ñātiseṭṭho bhagavato,
  avidūreva tiṭṭhati.

+ Āpattianāpattiyā, satekicchāya kovido; Vinaye agganikkhitto, upāli
