+ Sukhumanipuṇatthapaṭividdho, kathikānaṃ pavaro gaṇī; Isi mantāniyā
  putto, puṇṇo nāmāti vissuto.

+ Etesaṃ cittamaññāya, opammakusalo muni; Kaṅkhacchedo mahāvīro, kathesi
