+ Devā dibbehi turiyehi, manussā mānusehi ca \[mānussakehi ca mānusakehi
  ca (syā. ka.)\]; Ubhopi te vajjayantā, anuyanti tathāgataṃ.

+ Dibbaṃ mandāravaṃ pupphaṃ, padumaṃ pārichattakaṃ; Disodisaṃ okiranti,
