+ ‘‘‘Vimalo hoti sūriyo, sabbā dissanti tārakā; Tepi ajja padissanti,
  dhuvaṃ buddho bhavissasi.

+ ‘‘‘Anovaṭṭhena \[anovuṭṭhena (syā. ka.)\] udakaṃ, mahiyā ubbhijji
