=== Anomadassībuddhavaṃso

+ Sobhitassa aparena, sambuddho dvipaduttamo; Anomadassī amitayaso,
  tejassī duratikkamo.

+ So chetvā bandhanaṃ sabbaṃ, viddhaṃsetvā tayo bhave; Anivattigamanaṃ
