  phullito.

+ Dassanenapi taṃ buddhaṃ, tositā honti pāṇino; Byāharantaṃ giraṃ sutvā,
  amataṃ pāpuṇanti te.

+ Dhammābhisamayo tassa, iddho phīto tadā ahu; Koṭisatāni abhisamiṃsu,
  paṭhame dhammadesane.

+ Tato paraṃ abhisamaye, vassante dhammavuṭṭhiyo; Asītikoṭiyobhisamiṃsu,
  dutiye dhammadesane.

